diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..315b863 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,45 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers a browser's [Web Push](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Push_API) subscription for the current user, so that notifications landing in their tray are also pushed to that device. Only the user's own subscriptions can be registered. Handing over an endpoint that's already registered refreshes its keys instead of adding a duplicate.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service URL from the browser's `PushSubscription` |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's `p256dh` key, base64url encoded |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's `auth` secret, base64url encoded |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/send/abc123",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNcRd...",
+    "auth_key": "tBHI..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the registered subscription.
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+  "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/send/abc123",
+  "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:03:58.000Z"
+}
+```
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Stops pushing notifications to a device.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
